<title>GERMANY: Kohl says 2.5 pct GDP growth possible in 1997.</title>
<headline>Kohl says 2.5 pct GDP growth possible in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl said German economic growth of 2.5 percent was possible this year, in line with the government's standing forecast, and that it could accelerate to 3.0 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>Kohl was speaking at an entrepreneurs' conference in Munich.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
